// Issue #3127: the placement spec names a component to the runner, so a
// component spelled like a JS global (`Promise`) cannot be renamed.
// backends/typescript/emit.py::_refuse_module_collision refuses the document;
// the port has no refusal channel, so selfhost/emit_ts.rvl names the component
// with `<<UNSUPPORTED-COMPONENT-MODULE-NAME:Promise>>` instead. Pinned by
// tests/test_selfhost_emit_ts.py::test_a_reference_refusal_is_named_by_the_port.

component Promise {
